subckt dut (VDD VSS VBIAS VBGR)
C1 (net3 VSS) capacitor c=1p
C2 (VBGR VSS) capacitor c=1p
M1 (net5 net4 VPREREG VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (net6 net4 VPREREG VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M3 (net2 VBIAS net5 VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M4 (net4 VBIAS net6 VDD) sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M5 (net2 net2 net3 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M6 (net4 net2 net3 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
Q1 (net3 net3 net1 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00 m=1
Q2 (net3 net3 net0 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00 m=1
R1 (net0 net1) resistor r=1k
R2 (net1 VSS) resistor r=1k
R3 (VBGR net3) resistor r=1k
